# Enum Select

## Summary
The edit-format component that ships inside the field — a dropdown constrained to the declared options. Declaring
the field is all it takes; the editor renders wherever the card is edited.

## Example
```ts
import enumField from 'https://cardstack.com/base/enum';

const Lane = enumField(StringField, { options: ['A', 'B'] });
@field lane = contains(Lane);
```
Custom editors replace it by overriding the field's `edit` format; the
value-attribute + input-event binding pattern applies.
